\item[(ii)] $\Pic({\ms})^{\deg=0}_{\Bbb{Q}}\leto{\sim} \Pic_{\Bbb{Q}}(\widehat{\ms})$.
\item[(iii)] $\Pic^+({\ms})\leto{\sim} \Pic^+(\widehat{\ms})$. If $\ml$ is a degree zero  line bundle on ${\ms}$, then the pullback map
